@Gideon, the first report in #inc-vtg-hartford was at **10:42 AM on 3 Aug**, your message "gate kiosks offline at Vantorre's Hartford plant." It said both inbound lanes were showing a white screen after badge scan.

The channel shows the guard working manually in the meantime. At 10:42 you noted the guard was "writing trailer numbers on a clipboard." At 11:03 Mateo posted that kiosk 1 was back and that the guard had checked in trailer 8836, which dispatch could see. The channel doesn't say what the guard did between 11:03 and the lanes recovering.

The thread doesn't record when the outage started, only when it was first reported. You also noted both lanes were working as of 11:07, and that the status-page access issue was tracked in INC-4821.
